  "title": "The Hackett Group® Introduces AI World Class HR Benchmarks",
  "summary": "A new organizational capability gap is emerging. According to The Hackett Group's new AI World Class HR benchmarks, the next competitive advantage won't be defined by technology adoption alone. It will be determined by how effectively organizations attract, develop, deploy, and retain talent. New research shows organizations redesigning hire-to-retire around AI can achieve: - Up to 119% higher recruiter productivity - Up to 57% faster time-to-fill - Up to 61% lower recruiting costs",
